WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.690
In this second season, figuring out the end of the series,

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.790
that was a big thing this year.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.760
And I can feel where we are and the GPS inside me

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.820
is telling me, we're here on the road to the end.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:26.660
Mr. Turner, may I come inside?

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.950
Who are you?

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.960
Aunt Josephine.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.240
When something happens in the cult

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.040
and they can't handle somebody, when

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:39.262
someone goes rogue and leaves the cult, Aunt Josephine comes.

00:00:39.262 --> 00:00:40.660
[SCARY MUSIC]

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.980
I need to see Leanne.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:46.240
She's in desperate need of my help.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.490
She comes in when everything goes wrong.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:52.360
She's the cleaner and once you meet Aunt Josephine,

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.560
that's usually the end.

00:00:59.688 --> 00:01:02.050
[CRASH]

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:05.140
It's interesting how you have a Leanne that's

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:08.020
going to be unapologetic, and say,

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.960
I'm no longer going to listen to rules,

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:14.020
I'm going to do what I want to do.

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.830
And she's saying, I want to be a part of this family.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:21.280
And there's really no way you can get me out of this family.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:25.570
Vanity is a sin, Aunt Josephine.

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:27.670
You're learning what the show is about,

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:29.770
and I think by the end of the season here,

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:34.240
we wanted you to feel like, wow, this family just made

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:39.330
a deal with somebody that they should be afraid of.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:43.110
I can feel a dark thing in me getting bigger.

